WEBVTT

00:07:28.694 --> 00:07:30.946
the space so that we can think.

00:07:32.072 --> 00:07:35.910
Ultimately, real freedom
is about choosing how

00:07:35.910 --> 00:07:38.996
and with whom we want
to be spending our time.

00:07:39.788 --> 00:07:40.789
Thank you.

00:07:40.789 --> 00:07:41.790
(Cheers)

00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:42.791
(Applause)